    "Staff and host terminology must use respectful localized equivalents (e.g. Spanish: 'Embajador / Miembro del Personal', Portuguese: 'Membro da Equipe', French: 'Membre de l'équipe', Japanese: 'キャストメンバー / スタッフ').",
    "Park and resort concepts like 'Rope Drop' should be translated contextually (e.g. Spanish: 'Apertura del parque / Entrada a primera hora').",
